# laser3015 with the default current loop (cur_bw 1000 instead of its
# config's 2000): Y1 and Y2 fight in the bridge's yaw, where each motor
# moves a quarter of the mass it is tuned for (DEBUGNOTES 2026-10-21). This
# documents the effect that dynwiz's mass step detects (an oscillation).
@program portal/portal_sim
@args portal/machine/retrofit/laser3015.portal
drv y1 conf0.cur_bw = 1000
drv y2 conf0.cur_bw = 1000
run 0.05
lcnc 1
run 0.3
mark
move 4 750 1540
print max_cur_y1 max_cur_y2
@expect portal.max_cur_y1 > 3
@expect portal.max_cur_y2 > 3
@reject ^ERROR
